},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m008-0061","start":61,"end":66,"surface":"魏公子無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004676","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m008-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"晉鄙","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004661","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m008-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"秦軍","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、譬喻或未定指代；不依記憶補姓名與親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m008-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"秦軍","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、譬喻或未定指代；不依記憶補姓名與親屬。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou","book_id":"b-shiji-083","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-083-luzou"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:p009","text":"於是平原君欲封魯連，魯連辭讓使者三，終不肯受。平原君乃置酒，酒酣起前，以千金為魯連壽。魯連笑曰：「所貴於天下之士者，為人排患釋難解紛亂而無取也。即有取者，是商賈之事也，而連不忍為也。」遂辭平原君而去，終身不復見。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m009-0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004663","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m009-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"魯連","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m009-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"魯連","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m009-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"使者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、譬喻或未定指代；不依記憶補姓名與親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m009-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004663","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m009-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"魯連","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m009-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"魯連","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m009-0085","start":85,"end":86,"surface":"連","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m009-0094","start":94,"end":97,"surface":"平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004663","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou","book_id":"b-shiji-083","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-083-luzou"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:p010","text":"其後二十餘年，燕將攻下聊城，聊城人或讒之燕，燕將懼誅，因保守聊城，不敢歸。齊田單攻聊城歲餘，士卒多死而聊城不下。魯連乃為書，約之矢以射城中，遺燕將。書曰：","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m010-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"燕將","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004677","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m010-0014","start":14,"end":17,"surface":"聊城人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、譬喻或未定指代；不依記憶補姓名與親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m010-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"燕將","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004677","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m010-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"齊田單","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004678","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m010-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"士卒","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、譬喻或未定指代；不依記憶補姓名與親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m010-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"魯連","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m010-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"燕將","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004677","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou","book_id":"b-shiji-083","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-083-luzou"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:p014","text":"燕將見魯連書，泣三日，猶豫不能自決。欲歸燕，已有隙，恐誅；欲降齊，所殺虜於齊甚眾，恐已降而後見辱。喟然嘆曰：「與人刃我，寧自刃。」乃自殺。聊城亂，田單遂屠聊城。歸而言魯連，欲爵之。魯連逃隱於海上，曰：「吾與富貴而詘於人，寧貧賤而輕世肆志焉。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m014-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"燕將","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004677","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m014-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"魯連","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m014-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"田單","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004678","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m014-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"魯連","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m014-0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"魯連","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou","book_id":"b-shiji-083","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-083-luzou"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:p027","text":"太史公曰：魯連其指意雖不合大義，然余多其在布衣之位，蕩然肆志，不詘於諸侯，談說於當世，折卿相之權。鄒陽辭雖不遜，然其比物連類，有足悲者，亦可謂抗直不橈矣，吾是以附之列傳焉。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m027-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004744","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m027-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"魯連","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m027-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或未定指代保留，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m027-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"卿相","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或未定指代保留，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m027-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"鄒陽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004689","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou","book_id":"b-shiji-083","work_id":"w-shiji","source_